| 屏障 | cycles | ns | 扣基线后 cyc |
|---|---|---|---|
| (无 fence, 基线)      |     0.00 |    0.00 |     0.00 |
| membar.cta               |    12.01 |    6.07 |    12.01 |
| membar.gl                |   275.51 |  139.15 |   275.51 |
| membar.sys               |  1166.54 |  589.16 |  1166.53 |
